{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓劇《魷魚遊戲》男星李政宰與私交甚篤的鄭雨盛，於2016年共同創立Artist Company事務所，目前李政宰持有27.1%股權，是公司最大股東，而持有10.99%股權的鄭雨盛則於本月初，提早約半年辭去理事職務，並逐步出售股份。</p><p>&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T15:23:53.289419+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T15:05:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:14.251634+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T15:17:14.251634+00:00","content_hash":"a18c9805954b34e8ce60c197539941f958294624bf3c03dac8a3e83873a55390","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}